Subject: [PATCH 187/188] XD Netplay: battle records say which four Pokemon
 each player brought, and name item effects

The four come from the block XD sends each GBA at every choice (read only). Heals by Leftovers and Sitrus Berry and a White Herb's restore are labeled from each Pokemon's held item.
